      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TREACHEROUS PRINCE (7) broke last start and finished 12 metres from the winner in eighth over 2185m at Pinjarra in an inauspicious start to his career. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. Won't find this any harder and with better racing manners should be figuring in the finish. ULTIMATE SHOT (9) comes here following a Group One sixth a week-and-a-half ago over 2130m at this track, beaten 10 metres by Hez The Boss. Proven performer against better fields than this and looks hard to beat. JE SUIS LOUIE (3) lines up for the first time. By Sweet Lou and hails from the Aiden De Campo stable. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Trial winner who looks above average and is likely to attract plenty of interest from punters. JIMMYS RAINBOW (4) showed pleasing improvement last time out when runner-up over 2130m at this track after having found the front early and then racing in behind the leader.",
